<LegalLayout title="Shipping policy" eyebrow="Pan-India delivery" description="How BookMojo produces, dispatches and delivers personalised books across India.">
  <h2>Delivery coverage</h2>
  <p>We offer pan-India delivery across more than 19,000 serviceable PIN codes. Serviceability is confirmed before an order is accepted.</p>

  <h2>Production and transit</h2>
  <p>Personalised books usually take 5–7 working days to produce after final approval. Estimated transit is 2–3 working days to major metros and 4–6 working days to many other locations.</p>

  <h2>Tracking</h2>
  <p>Tracking details are shared after dispatch. Tracking scans can take up to 24 hours to appear after a courier receives the parcel.</p>

  <h2>Address accuracy</h2>
  <p>Please provide a complete address, landmark and correct PIN code. Contact us promptly if a correction is needed. Changes may not be possible after dispatch, and re-delivery charges may apply when an incorrect address causes a return.</p>

  <h2>Delays and damaged parcels</h2>
  <p>Courier, weather and regional disruptions may affect estimates. If a parcel arrives visibly damaged, photograph the outer packaging and product and email <a href="mailto:hello@bookmojo.in">hello@bookmojo.in</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>